lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI沙特籍工程师因非法安装录音设备窃听高管会议被捕</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">IDC 报告：英伟达中国 AI 芯片份额跌至 34%，华为追到 28%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Higgsfield接入GPT-6 Astra，AI视频生成时长提升至10分钟并解决角色串戏</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布HomeView等四款智能家居新品，Siri AI全面进驻家庭生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f018c376cd64e0e60bf82308de3ccbfc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司在“欢迎回家”发布会上推出四款智能家居新品，正式将基于Apple Foundation Models的Siri AI引入家庭生态。核心产品Apple HomeView智能显示屏采用7英寸Liquid Retina屏幕，支持面部识别与个性化主屏，定价299美元，11月13日发售。新款Apple TV 4K搭载A19芯片，CPU与GPU性能分别提升50%及2倍，支持远场语音唤醒与上下文连续追问。第二代HomePod mini升级S10芯片，支持四声道环绕声系统，售价149美元。此外，苹果联合LG与施耐德电气推出Apple Home Collection系列，涵盖安防摄像头、UWB智能门锁及温控器等设备。此次布局标志着苹果在智能家居领域从单一硬件向AI驱动的深度交互生态转型，通过Siri AI提供更自然的对话</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋追加20亿美元投资欧洲，并注资四家法国AI初创企业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋于10月13日宣布，将在原有基础上追加20亿美元投资欧洲，过去一年英伟达在该地区的总投入已达80亿美元。黄仁勋在巴黎访问期间明确表示“欧洲必须加入AI竞争”，并强调通过开源模型实现技术主权的重要性。此次投资重点布局四家法国初创企业：医疗预约平台Doctolib、企业AI管理软件商Pigment、化学材料AI研发商Entalpic以及机器人技术公司Genesis AI。英伟达此前已与Mistral AI建立深度合作，为其提供4000颗Grace Blackwell GPU用于模型训练。黄仁勋此举旨在通过资本绑定欧洲生态，推动“物理AI”及人形机器人技术发展，同时降低市场对单一美国巨头的依赖。尽管面临欧洲公众对数据中心能耗及模型安全的质疑，英伟达仍计划在全球范围内持续投入数千亿美元，以加速AI应用</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI沙特籍工程师因非法安装录音设备窃听高管会议被捕</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国司法部公告显示，OpenAI沙特籍工程师Abdulrahman Alfozan因涉嫌在旧金山办公室高管会议室安装隐藏录音设备，已被逮捕并控以“非法拦截口头通信”罪名。Alfozan于2025年7月入职，9月28日在会议室电视机背后的USB端口安装录音装置，该设备于9月30日被OpenAI安全团队发现。调查显示，Alfozan利用生产力工具检索高管会议排期，并通过关联配偶的聊天机器人账户咨询监听技术细节。该会议室涉及专有研究、产品规划及政府合作等核心机密。目前OpenAI已将其解雇并移交FBI处理，官方初步评估认为模型权重、源代码及客户数据未受影响。若罪名成立，Alfozan最高将面临5年监禁及25万美元罚款。此事件暴露了AI巨头在物理安全管控及内部人员权限管理方面的潜在漏洞，引发行业对核心资产保护的深度关注</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">IDC 报告：英伟达中国 AI 芯片份额跌至 34%，华为追到 28%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4f24aa4d27e1ee5273cde56e6fb8a295.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">IDC 报告：英伟达中国 AI 芯片份额跌至 34%，华为追到 28%AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 13, 202638据路透社看到的 IDC 报告，2026 年上半年，英伟达在中国数据中心 AI 芯片市场的占有率滑落到 34%。背后推手清晰：美国出口管制捆住了其产品供应，而中国本土对手趁机扩张。IDC 数据显示，今年 1 至 6 月，英伟达在华 AI 加速器（用于训练与运行 AI 模型）出货量仅 67.8 万颗，同比骤降 44%。CEO 黄仁勋早就不止一次炮轰华盛顿的限令，直言这套政策逼着英伟达把中国这块价值 500 亿美元的 AI 芯片市场，拱手送给华为。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Higgsfield接入GPT-6 Astra，AI视频生成时长提升至10分钟并解决角色串戏</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d8050676c877408762baaa7c6e1e93f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI视频生成平台Higgsfield宣布接入GPT-6 Astra，将AI生成视频的时长上限从1分钟提升至10分钟。GPT-6 Astra作为核心驱动，通过调用外部工具实现“创意智能体”统筹，有效解决了长视频中角色长相、场景及视觉细节不一致的“串戏”问题。目前，Higgsfield已利用该技术在其拥有近50万订阅者的YouTube频道产出长教学视频。此外，平台还集成了GPT-Image-2.5以提升文字和信息图的渲染稳定性，并借助OpenAI的Codex加速产品迭代。Higgsfield计划下一阶段基于GPT-Live-1探索“语音到视频”的实时创作模式，旨在通过自动化流程降低长内容制作门槛，进一步冲击传统视频制作领域。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
